{"accountName": "奇安信CERT", "author": "奇安信CERT", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "奇安信 CERT 2026-11-22 12:43 江苏", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555sJ0INXHpiafhZEIJUvevqnf01lYxhh0aAunzVBM0EJ3tc1YoX4nvZmrIAhtcvl5SR6NaBa2OO1M5c1E1DS3qmXmObIMxrnlNmg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞概述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞名称", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RwAbCjh555sibBQibVo62XbUbZddlaqXGTb6LS21LRJru1zkxAbkNLgrLZ637ebdzBQen36GTiatkGM2rFxsAn59TSdcWgUgMDamaDbiaXjQjfk/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "QVD-2026-106490 ， CVE-2026-125396", "type": "p"}, {"text": "公开时间", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555tRrMO19cT8HobM6R607RzBrVpy3Sx2EhYlMiavpPniaqGEibZf0iclHO77ymmyMC59HiapnPOwdJyszdVn0Hlrh1YL1ibROvG6xIplY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&tp=webp#imgIndex=2", "type": "img"}, {"text": "2026-11-09", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响量级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "十万级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信评级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "高危", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVSS 4.0分数", "type": "p"}, {"text": "8.5", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁类型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "代码执行", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用可能性", "type": "p"}, {"text": "POC状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "在野利用状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "未发现", "type": "p"}, {"text": "EXP状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "未公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "技术细节状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "危害描述： 攻击者利用 save/restore 机制造成释放后使用（Use-After-Free），获得写任意地址的原语，进而破坏 -dSAFER 状态并执行任意代码。成功利用该漏洞后可在 Ghostscript 进程权限下执行系统命令。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0 1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞详情", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Ghostscript 是由 Artifex Software 开发的开源解释器，主要用于处理 PostScript、PDF、PCL 等页面描述语言，广泛应用于打印系统、文档转换、图像处理及预览生成场景。它可作为独立工具运行，也可被 ImageMagick、Pillow、CUPS、PHP Imagick 等组件调用，是许多 Linux 发行版和服务器应用的基础依赖组件。其 -dSAFER 模式旨在限制文件访问与命令执行，以隔离不可信文档。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞描述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2.攻击者能够将恶意 PostScript/PDF 文档提交到该处理流程（上传表单、邮件、打印队列等）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3.处理时通常以 -dSAFER 模式运行。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "02", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响范围", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响版本", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Artifex Ghostscript < 10.08.0", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其他受影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "所有在 -dSAFER 沙箱模式下处理不受信任 PostScript/PDF 文档的 Ghostscript 部署环境均受影响，包括打印服务（CUPS）、邮件附件缩略图（Roundcube）、文件上传/预览（WordPress 插件、MediaWiki、DokuWiki 等）、文档转换管道（ImageMagick、Pillow 等）及云端文档渲染器。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "03", "type": "p"}, {"text": "复现情况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目前， 奇安信CERT已成功复现 Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞(CVE-2026-125396) ，截图如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "04", "type": "p"}, {"text": "处置建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全更新", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Artifex Ghostscript >= 10.08.0", "type": "p"}, {"text": "下载地址：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://www.ghostscript.com/releases/index.html", "type": "p"}, {"text": "对于使用发行版包的系统，安装对应安全更新：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Debian 13：10.05.1~dfsg-1+deb13u2 / +deb13u3 及以上", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Ubuntu：参考 USN-8949-1 对应版本", "type": "p"}, {"text": "openSUSE Tumbleweed、Arch、Alpine、Gentoo 等已提供 10.08.0 包", "type": "p"}, {"text": "重启依赖 Ghostscript 的服务（CUPS、PHP-FPM、预览/转换工作进程、容器等）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "容器镜像与内嵌 Ghostscript 的应用需重新构建。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 用户升级至 7.0.4 或对应分支修复版本；Roundcube 应用相关加固更新。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "临时缓解措施：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1.限制仅处理来自可信来源的文档，禁用或严格控制公共上传、预览、打印队列与邮件附件自动渲染功能；", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2.以最低权限运行 Ghostscript 相关进程，并结合容器/沙箱隔离；", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3.对图像处理库配置严格策略，避免不必要的 PostScript/PDF 委托；", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4.监控渲染进程异常子进程创建、异常错误日志与命令执行行为；", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.在无法立即升级的环境中，暂时禁用相关预览/转换功能或增加文件类型与内容校验。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "05", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[1] https://bugs.ghostscript.com/show_bug.cgi?id=709684", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[2] https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commit/1484854e0c8ddfda1baa4ad4cd965b8a9790aa81", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[3] https://pwn.ai/upload2shell", "type": "p"}, {"text": "06", "type": "p"}, {"text": "时间线", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年11月22日，奇安信 CERT发布安全风险通告。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "07", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞情报服务", "type": "p"}, {"text": "「 奇安信漏洞情报平台 」 重磅上线，诚邀您来体验：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信 CERT", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于 第一时间为企业级用户提供 权威 漏洞情报和 有效 解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "本文已发布于NCC国家网络安全云社区 https://nccsec.cn/security-community", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点击↓ 阅读原文 ，到 ALPHA威胁分析平台 订阅更多漏洞信息。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555sJ0INXHpiafhZEIJUvevqnf01lYxhh0aAunzVBM0EJ3tc1YoX4nvZmrIAhtcvl5SR6NaBa2OO1M5c1E1DS3qmXmObIMxrnlNmg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月22日", "id": "1414454189", "summary": "奇安信 CERT 2026-11-22 12:43 江苏 \n致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。\n●  点击↑蓝字关注我们，获取更多安全风险通告。 \n漏洞概述 \n漏洞名称 \nArtifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 \n漏洞编号 \nQVD-2026-106490 ， CVE-2026-125396 \n公开时间 \n2026-11-09 \n影响量级 \n十", "title": "【已复现】Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞(CVE-2026-125396)安全风险通告", "ts": 1795322580000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508224&idx=1&sn=2ab11be61822d4389080836c4f6663af"}